sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Integration test
  participant P as Disposable PostgreSQL DB
  participant D as Disposable Debezium connector
  participant K as UUID Kafka topic
  participant C as Kafka console consumer
  participant O as Orders connector/topic

  T->>O: Capture production connector, slot and high-water marks
  T->>P: Create bounded table, seed rows, publication
  T->>D: Register initial snapshot with unique slot/prefix
  D->>P: Open consistent snapshot and read table
  D->>K: Emit snapshot READ records
  T->>K: Observe partial snapshot high-water
  T->>P: Update existing keys and insert new keys
  P-->>D: WAL changes after snapshot position
  D->>K: Emit overlapping UPDATE/CREATE records
  C->>K: Read full partition in offset order
  T->>P: Read authoritative final table
  T->>T: Fold records and compare final keyed state
  T->>D: Delete only UUID connector
  T->>P: Drop only UUID slot/publication/database
  T->>O: Verify production connector and topic are unchanged
